{"id":"f0fcafbbba849fbf","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-thm-huisken.md","title":"Huisken's Theorem","display":"thm-huisken — Huisken's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-huisken","aliases":["58-thm-huisken"],"display":"thm-huisken — Huisken's Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-mean-curvature]]","[[58-df-compact]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-huisken"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-huisken</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-huisken — Huisken's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1946c1e666e6036a\" href=\"?note=1946c1e666e6036a\" title=\"58-df-mean-curvature\">58-df-mean-curvature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"58-df-compact\">58-df-compact</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaximalMeanCurvatureFlow}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{MaximalMeanCurvatureFlow}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\cup V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\cup V^{4}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is a compact smooth <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-manifold, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_0:M\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb R^{n+1}\">\\(F_0:M\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\)</span> is an embedding</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:M\\times[0,T)\\to\\mathbb R^{n+1}\">\\(F:M\\times[0,T)\\to\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\)</span> is a maximal smooth mean-curvature flow and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_t=F_t[M]\">\\(M_t=F_t[M]\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\\)</span> is the topology-explicit predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1946c1e666e6036a\" href=\"?note=1946c1e666e6036a\" title=\"58-df-mean-curvature\">58-df-mean-curvature</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaximalMeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\">\\(\\mathrm{MaximalMeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\\)</span> is its nonextendible maximal-flow refinement defined below</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_{F_0}\">\\(h_{F_0}\\)</span> is the second fundamental form with respect to the inward unit normal</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>convergence in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty\">\\(C^\\infty\\)</span> is understood after smooth reparametrization of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}mean\\text{-}curvature\\text{-}flow}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MaximalMeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\neg\\exists\\widetilde F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(\\widetilde F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T+\\varepsilon),n)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{118pt}\\land\n\\widetilde F\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\bigl(M\\times[0,T)\\bigr)=F\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}mean\\text{-}curvature\\text{-}flow}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MaximalMeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\neg\\exists\\widetilde F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(\\widetilde F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T+\\varepsilon),n)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{118pt}\\land\n\\widetilde F\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\bigl(M\\times[0,T)\\bigr)=F\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}huisken}\\vdash{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(M,\\tau_M)\\land\n\\mathrm{MaximalMeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\n\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall0\\neq v\\in T_pM\\;(h_{F_0,p}(v,v)&gt;0)\\\\\n&amp;\\to T&lt;\\infty\\land\\exists x_*\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\lim_{t\\uparrow T}\\sup_{p\\in M}\\|F(p,t)-x_*\\|=0\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{105pt}\\land\n\\frac{F_t-x_*}{\\sqrt{2n(T-t)}}\\xrightarrow[t\\uparrow T]{C^\\infty}S^n\n\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}huisken}\\vdash{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(M,\\tau_M)\\land\n\\mathrm{MaximalMeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\n\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall0\\neq v\\in T_pM\\;(h_{F_0,p}(v,v)&gt;0)\\\\\n&amp;\\to T&lt;\\infty\\land\\exists x_*\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\lim_{t\\uparrow T}\\sup_{p\\in M}\\|F(p,t)-x_*\\|=0\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{105pt}\\land\n\\frac{F_t-x_*}{\\sqrt{2n(T-t)}}\\xrightarrow[t\\uparrow T]{C^\\infty}S^n\n\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Maximality is essential: restricting a flow to an arbitrary short interval would not imply extinction at its endpoint.</li>\n<li>Flow shrinks convex hypersurfaces to points in finite time.</li>\n<li>After parabolic rescaling about the extinction point, the hypersurfaces converge smoothly to a round sphere.</li>\n<li>Limit at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>: &quot;round point&quot; singularity.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-mean-curvature","status":"resolved","id":"1946c1e666e6036a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-mean-curvature]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-compact","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-compact]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-mean-curvature","status":"resolved","id":"1946c1e666e6036a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)$ is the topology-explicit predicate from [[58-df-mean-curvature]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaximalMeanCurvatureFlow}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\cup V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"F_0:M\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb R^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"F:M\\times[0,T)\\to\\mathbb R^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"M_t=F_t[M]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaximalMeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)","display":false},{"tex":"h_{F_0}","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}mean\\text{-}curvature\\text{-}flow}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{MaximalMeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\neg\\exists\\widetilde F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MeanCurvatureFlow}_S(\\widetilde F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T+\\varepsilon),n)\\\\\n&\\hspace{118pt}\\land\n\\widetilde F\\!\\upharpoonright\\!\\bigl(M\\times[0,T)\\bigr)=F\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}huisken}\\vdash{}&\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(M,\\tau_M)\\land\n\\mathrm{MaximalMeanCurvatureFlow}_S(F,M,\\tau_M,[0,T),n)\n\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall0\\neq v\\in T_pM\\;(h_{F_0,p}(v,v)>0)\\\\\n&\\to T<\\infty\\land\\exists x_*\\in\\mathbb R^{n+1}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\lim_{t\\uparrow T}\\sup_{p\\in M}\\|F(p,t)-x_*\\|=0\\\\\n&\\hspace{105pt}\\land\n\\frac{F_t-x_*}{\\sqrt{2n(T-t)}}\\xrightarrow[t\\uparrow T]{C^\\infty}S^n\n\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":2418,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4214","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-huisken.md|58-thm-huisken]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["1946c1e666e6036a","050f6d05b2c94aea"]}